    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Neutronium is a heavy, neutron-rich metallic alloy used to make Armor and reinforce <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starships\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starships\">Starships</a>. It can also be used to harden and sharpen the striking or cutting surface of Melee Weapons other than <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsabers\" title=\"Lightsabers\">Lightsabers</a>. Any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> given Neutronium Reinforcement gains +5 DR (Maximum DR 15), 10 Hit Points, and +100% weight. A Slashing or Piercing Melee Weapon given Neutronium Reinforcement scores a Critical Hit on a natural roll of 19 or 20. (Only a Natural 20 is an automatic hit, however.) </p>",
